sql temporary password  so we can do that by using the  phpmyadmin web interface that's provided  to us  now that we're more secure let's go back  and change our landing page to something  custom  we can ssh into the vm and act as the  root user to customize the index.html  [Music]  page  [Music]  we can refresh our ip url and now we  have our very simple  yet customized lamp stack deployed at  the click of a button  using the google cloud marketplace  if you enjoyed this video please  subscribe and hit the like button below  we encourage you to check out the gcp  marketplace and deploy this solution on  your own  thanks for watching  you

